OL,5,G0105 F1 United States GP Qualifying...
OL,6,     F...Highlights: Antonelli has a
OL,7,     Fmathematical chance of wrapping up
OL,8,     Fthe World Championship here in
OL,9,     FTexas... if he can win the GP
OL,10,     Flater today. So he'll be
OL,11,     Fdetermined to do well in
OL,12,     FQualifying.
OL,13,G0155 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,14,     FJack's Waterfront: In Michigan,
OL,15,     FGordon Ramsay visits a lakeside
OL,16,     Frestaurant in a summer hotspot,
OL,17,     Fwhere the food fails to match the
OL,18,     Ffantastic views. Can Gordon turn
OL,19,     Fthe tide?
